cfg.sync_status:
🔗 <b>Settings sync: {state}</b>
{detail}
Change it with <code>/sync on</code> or <code>/sync off</code> (or from /config).

hdl.bot_added_kicked:
🤖 <b>Bot added and removed</b>
📍 Chat: {chat}
🤖 Bot: @{bot_username} (<code>{bot_id}</code>)
👤 Added by: {adder}{adder_id}

<i>I removed it as a precaution. If it is legitimate, add it again and grant it permissions.</i>

hdl.channel_banned:
{prefix}🚫 <b>Channel banned for spamming in the comments</b>
📍 Chat: {chat}
📢 Channel: {channel} (<code>{channel_id}</code>)
📖 Reason: {rule}

hdl.via_bot_deleted:
⚠️ <b>Spam message via inline bot deleted</b>
📍 Chat: {chat}
👤 User: <a href="tg://user?id={uid}">{name}</a> (<code>{uid}</code>)
🤖 Via bot: @{via_bot}
🔘 {n_buttons} spam buttons

<i>I have not banned them (they may be an established user). If you want, reply to their message with /ban or use their id.</i>

hdl.shadow_notice:
🌒 <b>[SHADOW MODE — no action taken]</b>
📍 Chat: {chat}
👤 {user_link} (<code>{uid}</code>)
⚖️ {would}
📖 Reason: {reason}
🚨 Rule: <code>{rule}</code>
📏 Score: {score}

<i>This is test mode: set MODE=active in the .env for it to act for real.</i>

admin.start:
🤖 <b>CazaSpamBot up and running</b>

{mode_emoji} <b>Mode:</b> <code>{mode}</code>
🌐 <b>Federation:</b> {federation}
🛡️ <b>CAS:</b> {cas}
❤️ <b>Reactions:</b> {reactions}
📜 <b>Allowed scripts:</b> {scripts}

📊 <b>Stats</b>
  Chats: <b>{chats}</b> · Users seen: <b>{seen_users}</b>
  Active bans: <b>{banned}</b> · Actions 24h: <b>{actions_24h}</b>

Use /help to see every command.

hdl.review_dm:
🔎 <b>Spam review</b>

👤 <code>{uid}</code> ({name}) · trust {trust}
📍 {chat}
🚨 Rules: <code>{rules}</code>
⚖️ Proposed action: <b>{action}</b>
💬 Reason: {reason}

<b>Message:</b>
<pre>{text}</pre>

tb.manual_delete:
🗑️ <b>Message deleted manually</b>
📍 Chat: {chat}
👮 Deleted by: {actor}
👤 Message author: {author_link} (<code>{author_id}</code>){state}
🆔 msg_id: <code>{msg_id}</code>

<b>Content:</b>
<pre>{content}</pre>

hdl.bot_removed_alert:
⚠️ <b>I lost access to a group</b>: {verb} of <b>{chat}</b> (<code>{chat_id}</code>)
👮 By: {actor}{actor_id}

<i>I cannot moderate there until someone adds me back as an admin.</i>

quipcfg.text:
😏 <b>Ban one-liners</b>

{state}

<b>This is how it would look in the group</b> (made-up user):
{example}

<i>It only goes out after a ban and deletes itself after a while. It never links to the banned user's profile.</i>

cfg.sc.text:
🔤 <b>Allowed alphabets</b> · {title}

The bot flags messages written in an alphabet that is not allowed here. If your community writes in Cyrillic, Arabic or Chinese, turn it on or the bot will end up flagging your regular members.

Allowed now: <b>{allowed}</b>
{source}

hdl.trust_notice_dm:
🤔 <b>Something odd from a trusted user</b>

<b>User:</b> {name} (id: {uid})
<b>Trust:</b> {trust}
<b>Group:</b> {chat}

<b>Would have triggered:</b> {rules} → <b>{action}</b>
<b>Reason:</b> {reason}

<b>Message:</b>
<code>{text}</code>

<i>I did nothing: their history speaks for them. But a trusted account can be stolen, or its owner may have shared this without looking. Your call.</i>
